| !Run for Folio, a reader for PDF and ebook files.
| Built with riscos-crossdev 1.4 (GCC 10.2, UnixLib 5.0.3.3), statically
| linked with MuPDF 1.28.5, and converted to an Absolute file.
Set Folio$Dir <Obey$Dir>
IconSprites <Folio$Dir>.!Sprites

| --- Runtime support -------------------------------------------------
RMEnsure SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 IfThere System:Modules.SharedULib Then RMLoad System:Modules.SharedULib
RMEnsure SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 Error Folio needs SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 or later. Install it with PackMan.
RMEnsure ARMEABISupport 0 IfThere System:Modules.ARMEABISupport Then RMLoad System:Modules.ARMEABISupport
RMEnsure ARMEABISupport 0 Error Folio needs the ARMEABISupport module. Install it with PackMan.

| --- Toolbox (in the RISC OS 5 ROM) -------------------------------------
RMEnsure Toolbox 0 RMLoad System:Modules.Toolbox.Toolbox
RMEnsure Toolbox 0 Error Folio needs the Toolbox module Toolbox (in the RISC OS 5 ROM).
RMEnsure Window 0 RMLoad System:Modules.Toolbox.Window
RMEnsure Window 0 Error Folio needs the Toolbox module Window (in the RISC OS 5 ROM).
RMEnsure Menu 0 RMLoad System:Modules.Toolbox.Menu
RMEnsure Menu 0 Error Folio needs the Toolbox module Menu (in the RISC OS 5 ROM).
RMEnsure Iconbar 0 RMLoad System:Modules.Toolbox.Iconbar
RMEnsure Iconbar 0 Error Folio needs the Toolbox module Iconbar (in the RISC OS 5 ROM).
RMEnsure ProgInfo 0 RMLoad System:Modules.Toolbox.ProgInfo
RMEnsure ProgInfo 0 Error Folio needs the Toolbox module ProgInfo (in the RISC OS 5 ROM).

| --- Memory ---------------------------------------------------------
| MuPDF's cache and the page pictures go in a dynamic area, "Folio Heap",
| removed when Folio quits. The WimpSlot only holds the program itself.
| Choices (layouts of books) go in <Choices$Write>.Folio.
WimpSlot -min 20480K -max 20480K
| A log of what Folio did goes in <Wimp$ScrapDir>.FolioLog.
Run <Folio$Dir>.!RunImage %*0
